{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And Ya'akov blessed.</b> As is the way of all who take leave of princes — they bless them and take permission. And what blessing did he bless him? That the Nile would rise to his feet, since Egypt does not drink rainwater but the Nile rises and waters it. And from Ya'akov's blessing onward, Pharaoh would come to the Nile and it would rise to meet him and water the land (Tanchuma)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:03:47.300409058Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}